           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Branding Tips for Georgetown Businesses",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>A logo with a classic or vintage feel can complement Georgetown's historic downtown character.</li><li>If you are near the square, check any local sign guidelines before ordering signage.</li><li>Create a label or badge version if you sell packaged goods.</li><li>Keep a simplified version for social media profile images.</li></ul>",
