           "text": "Georgetown Logo Design FAQs",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Do you design logos for Georgetown, TX businesses?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Georgetown is one of Logo Austin's most frequent service areas, and all work can be completed remotely.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can you design a vintage or classic-style logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin can create classic, vintage-inspired logos that suit historic downtown settings, along with modern versions for digital use.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a custom logo cost for a Georgetown business?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Logo Austin charges $125 to $175 for a custom logo, with no upfront payment. You pay only after approving the final design and receive JPG, PNG, SVG, PDF, AI and EPS files.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
